Changes made to the exports, by scripts/import-icons.sh:

  * Renamed to "atlas-<name>-symbolic.svg". GTK looks an icon up in the current
    theme first and falls back to hicolor last, so an icon sharing a name with
    the desktop theme's own would never be reached.
  * The preview colour the export carries was replaced with black, and a
    nominal 16x16 size was set. The artwork and its viewBox are untouched.
